{"id":"622016","name":"香菇菠菜汤面","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/622016/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"菠菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面条","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"西红柿","amount":"1个"},{"name":"芹菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"两个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材，洗净。","img":"images/622016/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切好。","img":"images/622016/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"葱姜切好。","img":"images/622016/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅内放油烧热，倒入鸡蛋炒熟。","img":"images/622016/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅内放油烧热，放入葱姜、西红柿、香菇。","img":"images/622016/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒制变软。","img":"images/622016/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入清水。","img":"images/622016/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅内烧开，下入面条。","img":"images/622016/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放生抽、蚝油、盐。","img":"images/622016/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"最后放入菠菜、芹菜、鸡蛋。","img":"images/622016/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"菠菜煮熟。","img":"images/622016/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"盛入碗里。","img":"images/622016/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"营养美味，非常好吃。","img":"images/622016/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}